{"id":"c14","stage":2,"title":"未来的打算","scene":"讲述目标和努力的原因。","roles":["敏智","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c14-1","ko":"한국어를 배워서 뭘 하고 싶어요?","zh":"你学了韩语后想做什么？","note":"-고 싶다 表示愿望。","words":[{"term":"싶다","zh":"想要","id":"b3ad33de22cbca64","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/6e863a326be9be4b873f.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"한국어를","meaning":"韩语","explanation":"한국어（韩语）+ 를（宾格助词）。","readings":[{"term":"한국어를","audio":"/audio/5ceaa932f63f4a694c6f.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국어를","audio":"/audio/5ceaa932f63f4a694c6f.mp3"}},{"text":"배워서","meaning":"学了以后","explanation":"배우다（学习）→ 배워서；-아서/어서连接前后动作，此处表示“学了韩语后”，不表示已经学会。","readings":[{"term":"배워서","audio":"/audio/4a2415ff73bde1c0fdf9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"배워서","audio":"/audio/4a2415ff73bde1c0fdf9.mp3"}},{"text":"뭘","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무엇을的缩略，含宾格助词을。","readings":[{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭘","audio":"/audio/441ab920d2baa0d1bea5.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"做","explanation":"하다（做）+ -고，与싶다组成愿望。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"싶어요?","meaning":"想要？","explanation":"싶다 + -어요；-고 싶다表示“想做”。","readings":[{"term":"싶다","audio":"/audio/b3ad33de22cbca646dc1.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶어요","audio":"/audio/cc38b96f98104f6017a8.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c14-2","ko":"한국 대학원에서 공부하고 싶어요.","zh":"我想在韩国读研究生。","note":"대학원 指研究生院。","words":[{"term":"대학원","zh":"研究生院","id":"9986b156ac970834","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/ef015753fc7ebac7d3d2.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"한국","meaning":"韩国","explanation":"한국修饰后面的대학원。","readings":[{"term":"대학원","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한국","audio":"/audio/1eb7da6d56d883ca1dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"대학원에서","meaning":"在研究生院","explanation":"대학원（研究生院）+ 에서（学习发生的地点）。","readings":[{"term":"대학원","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대학원에서","audio":"/audio/7d3b4414c235fec8c447.mp3"}},{"text":"공부하고","meaning":"学习","explanation":"공부하다（学习）+ -고，连接싶다。","readings":[{"term":"공부하고","audio":"/audio/42d0a2c3c3e4b0d70006.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부하고","audio":"/audio/42d0a2c3c3e4b0d70006.mp3"}},{"text":"싶어요.","meaning":"想","explanation":"싶다的礼貌形式；공부하고 싶어요表示想学习。","readings":[{"term":"싶어요","audio":"/audio/cc38b96f98104f6017a8.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"싶어요","audio":"/audio/cc38b96f98104f6017a8.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c14-3","ko":"그러려면 꾸준히 공부해야겠네요.","zh":"要那样的话，就得坚持学习了。","note":"그러려면：要做到那样的话。","words":[{"term":"꾸준히","zh":"持续地","id":"9af169ff99300cbb","audio":"/audio/9af169ff99300cbbbdbd.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/bc6b65db979e7f6cd3d2.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"그러려면","meaning":"要那样的话","explanation":"그러다（那样做）+ -려면（若想做到……）。","readings":[{"term":"그러려면","audio":"/audio/14a5229e20500da88cc1.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그러려면","audio":"/audio/14a5229e20500da88cc1.mp3"}},{"text":"꾸준히","meaning":"持续地","explanation":"꾸준히表示坚持、不间断。","readings":[{"term":"꾸준히","audio":"/audio/9af169ff99300cbbbdbd.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꾸준히","audio":"/audio/9af169ff99300cbbbdbd.mp3"}},{"text":"공부해야겠네요.","meaning":"看来得学习了","explanation":"공부하다 + -아/어야（必须）+ -겠-（判断）+ -네요（感悟）。","readings":[{"term":"공부해야겠네요","audio":"/audio/3e905eb0ea7084b3e5d0.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부해야겠네요","audio":"/audio/3e905eb0ea7084b3e5d0.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c14-4","ko":"매일 네 시간씩 공부하려고 해요.","zh":"我打算每天学习四小时。","note":"넷 变 네；씩 表示每次、每份。","words":[{"term":"매일","zh":"每天","id":"d5d6a44c9a892452","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"},{"term":"넷","zh":"四（固有数词）","id":"2752a0238ad7b1ee","audio":"/audio/2752a0238ad7b1eeb299.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/80a4d9659a59721d37db.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"每天","explanation":"매일是时间副词。","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}},{"text":"네","meaning":"四","explanation":"넷（四）在量词前用네；此处不是“是的”。","readings":[{"term":"넷","audio":"/audio/2752a0238ad7b1eeb299.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"시간씩","meaning":"每次……小时","explanation":"시간（小时）+ 씩（每次、每份）；与매일合为每天四小时。","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시간씩","audio":"/audio/bf2b5a9a3da87625ef23.mp3"}},{"text":"공부하려고","meaning":"打算学习","explanation":"공부하다 + -려고（意图），与하다构成打算。","readings":[{"term":"공부하려고","audio":"/audio/86e5953e1d66fd9484cc.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부하려고","audio":"/audio/86e5953e1d66fd9484cc.mp3"}},{"text":"해요.","meaning":"打算","explanation":"하다→해요；-려고 하다整体表示“计划做”。","readings":[{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해요","audio":"/audio/521029965a4dd3b2882e.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c14-5","ko":"어려워도 포기하지 마세요.","zh":"即使困难，也不要放弃。","note":"-아/어도 表示即使；-지 마세요 表示不要。","words":[{"term":"어렵다","zh":"困难","id":"55d0f08434308816","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"},{"term":"포기하다","zh":"放弃","id":"75c136ad3e41b441","audio":"/audio/75c136ad3e41b441a8ec.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b8b27a6981da0fb685f0.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"어려워도","meaning":"即使困难","explanation":"어렵다（难）→ 어려워도；ㅂ不规则变化，-아/어도表示让步。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려워도","audio":"/audio/ff6880f4a33576d66613.mp3"}},{"text":"포기하지","meaning":"放弃","explanation":"포기하다（放弃）+ -지，与말다构成禁止。","readings":[{"term":"포기하다","audio":"/audio/75c136ad3e41b441a8ec.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"포기하지","audio":"/audio/4eb2ad12cb3fd24f04c7.mp3"}},{"text":"마세요.","meaning":"请不要","explanation":"말다（不要）+ -세요；-지 마세요表示“请不要做”。","readings":[{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"마세요","audio":"/audio/0a355a328a450c9b0583.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c14-6","ko":"네, 작은 목표부터 실천할게요.","zh":"好的，我会从小目标开始实践。","note":"부터 在这里表示先从某一步开始。","words":[{"term":"목표","zh":"目标","id":"3182dd7d3d31e49a","audio":"/audio/3182dd7d3d31e49a00b9.mp3"},{"term":"실천하다","zh":"实践","id":"a144070ae9f0bfa0","audio":"/audio/a144070ae9f0bfa0ee3e.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b2e3957df2bebf99a415.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"好的","explanation":"네表示接受建议。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"작은","meaning":"小的","explanation":"작다（小）+ -은（定语形）。","readings":[{"term":"작은","audio":"/audio/ff7bc327debe9c5835f9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"작은","audio":"/audio/ff7bc327debe9c5835f9.mp3"}},{"text":"목표부터","meaning":"从目标开始","explanation":"목표（目标）+ 부터（起点、先从）。","readings":[{"term":"목표","audio":"/audio/3182dd7d3d31e49a00b9.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목표부터","audio":"/audio/dcac030f4ca988e3592a.mp3"}},{"text":"실천할게요.","meaning":"我会实践","explanation":"실천하다（实践）+ -ㄹ게요（表明自己的计划）。","readings":[{"term":"실천하다","audio":"/audio/a144070ae9f0bfa0ee3e.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"실천할게요","audio":"/audio/907710c8230715a3dd13.mp3"}}]}],"day":66,"sequenceScore":1.4267,"questions":[{"lineIndex":2,"options":["要那样的话，就得坚持学习了。","要那样的话，就得停止学习了。","要那样的话，就得马上回国了。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":4,"options":["因为困难，所以可以放弃。","即使困难，也不要放弃。","即使困难，也不要向人提问。"],"answer":1}]}
